{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794256013335,"sessionID":"ses_e3e09773affe45hbuT72sblo46","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_011BXRkwua1coMfYAA71qNUr","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Weather display\n\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,me,logout}`, `/api/weather` (list/search/create), `/api/weather/{id}` (get/replace/delete), `/api/weather/recent`. Write operations need `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from login.\n- Data: SQLite at `data/app.db` (override the directory with `DATA_DIR`). Sample reports are seeded on first start.\n- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS (`src/index.css` is the Tailwind entry). `npm run typecheck` runs `tsc`; `npm run build` type-checks and builds.\n- Local dev: `gunicorn --pythonpath backend app:app --bind 127.0.0.1:8000` and `npm run dev` in `frontend/` (proxies `/api`).\nEOF","workdir":"/workspace"},"output":"(no output)","metadata":{"output":"(no output)","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Weather display\n\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,me,logout}`, `/api/weather` (list/search/create), `/api/weather/{id}` (get/replace/delete), `/api/weather/recent`. Write operations need `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from login.\n- Data: SQLite at `data/app.db` (override the directory with `DATA_DIR`). Sample reports are seeded on first start.\n- Frontend: React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS (`src/index.css` is the Tailwind entry). `npm run typecheck` runs `tsc`; `npm run build` type-checks and builds.\n- Local dev: `gunicorn --pythonpath backend app:app --bind 127.0.0.1:8000` and `npm run dev` in `frontend/` (proxies `/api`).\nEOF","time":{"start":1794256013306,"end":1794256013318}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1fe07f4001lfxcqE4KyW7y3r","sessionID":"ses_e3e09773affe45hbuT72sblo46","messageID":"msg_1c1fdeeb3001fQwdmEMQIZENjW"}}
